flowchart LR
    A[Push or PR] --> B[Lint and Format]
    B --> C[Type Check]
    C --> D[Run Tests]
    D --> E{On Main Branch?}

    E -- Yes --> F[Build Image]
    F --> G{Is Tagged Release?}

    G -- Yes --> H{Manual Approval?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Deploy Production]
    I --> K[End]

    G -- No --> J[Deploy Staging]
    J --> K[End]

    E -- No --> K[End]